# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; never commit real secrets.
#
# Two kinds of variable live here:
#
# 1. Secrets read directly by third-party libraries. They never pass through
#    packagename.config, so no setting holds a credential.
# 2. Overrides for `configs/config.yaml`, which must be prefixed with
#    PACKAGENAME_ and use `__` to descend into a section.
#
# Precedence, lowest to highest: field defaults, configs/config.yaml, this file,
# real environment variables, then anything typed on the command line. So a
# value set here beats the YAML but loses to `packagename-train random_seed=7`.

# --- Weights & Biases ---------------------------------------------------------
# From https://wandb.ai/authorize. Only needed once you switch the mode to
# `online`; the shipped config records runs offline so a fresh clone just works.
# WANDB_API_KEY=

# --- Settings overrides -------------------------------------------------------
# PACKAGENAME_WANDB__MODE=online
# PACKAGENAME_WANDB__ENTITY=your-team
# PACKAGENAME_LOGGING__LEVEL=DEBUG
# PACKAGENAME_RANDOM_SEED=1234
